This project adapts the AgX fitted constants and algorithm structure from
Google Filament's AgxToneMapper in filament/src/ToneMapper.cpp, which cites
Blender's AgX LUT generation and the Minimal AgX implementation. The engine
shader retains the source attribution and URL in tonemap.frag.
